# Audit Chain Harness

## Status
VERIFIED — docker route passes `test_tampering.sh` twice (2026-11-07).

## Author Local Commands
Native user-space route (no Docker needed):
```bash
cd /path/to/repo
tools/env/up.sh
make test-02
```

Docker route (isolated project `nexo-s02`, port 15433 — distinct from the
native env's 15432):
```bash
cd samples/02-audit-chain/harness
docker compose up -d
NEXO_PG_PORT=15433 NEXO_SOCKET_DIR=/nonexistent bash test_tampering.sh
docker compose down -v
```

## What it tests
1. Valid HMAC chain verifies as `status: ok`
2. Middle-record tampering detected (`status: compromised`)
3. Record deletion detected
4. Record reordering detected
